<title>ISRAEL: PLO official calls summit a failure.</title>
<headline>PLO official calls summit a failure.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>A senior Palestinian negotiator called the emergency White House summit to end Israeli-Palestinian fighting on Wednesday a failure.</p>
<p>&quot;What happened in Washington was an American attempt to absorb the anger and reaction of Palestinians and to give the appearance of success,&quot; Hasan Asfour told Reuters. &quot;But the summit has failed because of Israeli intransigence.&quot;</p>
</text>
